s. Starting at the gate with engines off and external power connected. Low visibility for taxi, takeoff and landing.\nThis app can help users memorizing the checklist and increase the motor skills. Each step requires the user to touch with the hand to reach the item. \nThe app uses either hand tracking or controllers for interaction.\n", "short_description": "Virtual Reality Standard Operating Procedures trainer. a320 version.\nStep by step checklist for normal operation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://walkaroundapp.com/vrsops-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hundred Above Software Design", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hundredabove.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FLYING", "EDUCATIONAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3203280756659714"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4668026393236458", "version": "2.2"}, "id": "3003244213324789", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id